 "title": "Margin of a sales order, line by line: invoiced revenue net of credit memos against booked item-ledger cost",
 "description": "BC only (answers while the Portal API is down). An order BC deleted (root of a posted_bindings binding): one line per item, whole when invoiced = shipped ledger quantity. Per line: revenue = the posted invoice lines (SalesInvoice.bills, status Open/Paid) of the line's item, excluding tax, less the Item lines for that item of the posted credit memos applied to those invoices (SalesCreditMemo.applies_to), subtracted by document type, never by sign; booked cost = the shipped cost (minus the item ledger Cost Amount (Actual) of the Sale / Sales Shipment entries posted on the order's shipments, ItemLedgerEntry.posted_by_shipment) less the returned cost (that of the Sale / Sales Credit Memo entries of those memos, ItemLedgerEntry.posted_by_credit_memo); margin = revenue - booked cost, % on price. A line not wholly invoiced, a ledger set not proven whole, a missing actual cost, a credited return not on the item ledger, an unknown or second currency leave that line (and the total) null with a typed gap, never zero. Only a credit memo line of line type Item is goods: a Charge or Account credit is never netted into a line and leaves the order total unstated (credit_memo_line_unattributed). Only credit memos applied to the order's invoices are netted; the posted memos of the order's customer BC states no invoiceId for (SalesOrder.ordered_by, SalesCreditMemo.credited_to) are counted by one filtered plx.around and their applies_to resolved: one applied to no invoice (its invoiceNumber names no single invoice of the company) may credit this order, so the typed gap credit_memo_unattributed counts them and cites a few, never netted; unless the customer's memos are reached, readable by this reader and the BC capture is complete, the gap credit_memos_not_captured stays. A memo's returned cost is its own ledger entries. Portal and Sage twins and lead-tier documents never enter a sum. The landed-cost estimate (F7, plan landed_cost) is shown apart, never added to booked cost (ERP-D-015).",
